<title>USA: Daniel Industries Q1 shr runs loss.</title>
<headline>Daniel Industries Q1 shr runs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $1.05	   profit $0.17</p>
<p> Net loss	  17,944	  profit 2,810</p>
<p> Revs		53,975		   54,188</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  17,061		   17,002</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Daniel Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Company's fiscal first quarter ended December 31 but will begin reporting on a calendar basis from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>1996 figures include $16.7 million in pre-tax charges.</p>
<p>Results have been restated to include Bettis Corp, which merged with the company in December.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
